    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry Fitzgerald Paul Reynolds are offering for sale this superb 0.56-acre residential site situated in the highly desirable Woodlands area, offering an excellent opportunity to construct a substantial detached family home in a sought-after residential location.\nThe site is currently being offered for sale with the benefit of full planning permission for the construction of a detached two-storey dwelling incorporating a basement area.\nOn completion, the proposed property will provide a generous total floor area of approximately 289 sq m (3,110 sq ft).\nThe site occupies an elevated position, while benefiting from a convenient tarmac access road. All mains services abut the site, providing a straightforward connection for the proposed development.\nThis is an exceptional opportunity to acquire a substantial residential site with planning permission in one of the area's most desirable locations."
      },
      {
