        "Content": "<ul><li>0.56 acre site</li><li>Full planning permission for detached residence</li><li>Total floor area of proposed property 289 sq m</li><li>Site is elevated in aspect</li><li>Located within easy commuting distance of Letterkenny Town</ul>"
